 According to a new report from Intel Market Research, global Outdoor Cooking Equipment market was valued at USD 4.76 billion in 2024 and is projected to reach USD 8.02 billion by 2032, growing at a CAGR of 7.9% during the forecast period (2025-2032). This growth is driven by rising consumer interest in outdoor living, technological advancements in cooking equipment, and the expanding foodservice industry.

What is Outdoor Cooking Equipment?
The Outdoor Cooking Equipment market encompasses a wide range of products including grills, smokers, stoves, and fryers designed for both residential and commercial outdoor use. These products have evolved from simple cooking tools to sophisticated systems featuring smart technology integration, transforming backyards, patios, and outdoor events into culinary destinations. The market serves diverse needs from casual weekend barbecues to professional catering operations and outdoor adventure cooking.

This report provides comprehensive insights into the Outdoor Cooking Equipment market, analyzing everything from global market trends to specific competitive dynamics. It examines market drivers, challenges, opportunities, and emerging technologies that are reshaping outdoor cooking experiences.

